 chem:'M6.2 1.6v4.1L2.4 12.3A1.4 1.4 0 0 0 3.6 14.4h8.8a1.4 1.4 0 0 0 1.2-2.1L9.8 5.7V1.6M5.2 1.6h5.6M4.3 9.4h7.4',
